  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening policy and practice for tackling corruption in South Africa.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Will work to strengthen policy and practice in tackling corruption in South Africa by providing support to the National Anti-Corruption Advisory Council.  Will offer independent analysis on the strengths and weaknesses of the state responses to corruption. A key focus will be to better capacitate and support the work of the National Anti-Corruption Advisory Council.  Will work closely with the Special Investigation Unit  in enhancing the institutional architecture of anti-corruption agencies as mandated by the NACAC and provide support and assistance to the SIU to enhance its capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
